WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Calm: thin blue arcs. A long answer is typed out one character at a time.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The conversation piles up: the arcs turn orange and thicker, a sweat drop appears, and the balloon slowly swells.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Stretched to the limit (virtual): magenta, thickest arcs, trembling, squinting eyes. It hangs on the edge of bursting.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Attune steps in: pshh, the air goes out and the balloon shrinks. Answers get shorter and are typed more slowly.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A checkpoint card, then a rest. The mascot breathes slowly while the arcs turn orange again.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
A resume card picks up where you left off. The gauge falls back to blue, the label reads “Recovered”, and reply length and pace return to your defaults. All values are virtual.
